{"4824290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Star Sine Signal", "steam_appid": 4824290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Star Sine Signal is a short first-person non-linear puzzle game about exploring an ominous house ripped from time in order to free yourself, and your captor, from your shared prison. Activate the Signals. Follow the Signals. Free that which Binds You.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You Awaken in a Strange Place</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An otherworld being has plucked you from your reality and trapped you in their extradimensional prison. If you want to escape you are going to have to help them escape as well. Looks like you have no choice.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4824290/extras/4c963a72987970654133f8691ff7c273.poster.avif?t=1781141077\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4824290/extras/4c963a72987970654133f8691ff7c273.webm?t=1781141077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4824290/extras/4c963a72987970654133f8691ff7c273.mp4?t=1781141077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a Home Ripped from Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The key to your escape lies inside of an ominous floating home. Navigate the abandoned rooms to unravel the mysteries of this place and learn the secrets it holds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4824290/extras/3f46bfe850c30227e6383ca138fd6c1d.poster.avif?t=1781141077\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4824290/extras/3f46bfe850c30227e6383ca138fd6c1d.webm?t=1781141077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4824290/extras/3f46bfe850c30227e6383ca138fd6c1d.mp4?t=1781141077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Activate the Signals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the puzzles around the house to activate the signals. The puzzles will weave and interconnect throughout the house and teach you the rules that govern this strange place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4824290/extras/c63cfb2453c97ad3a203220593ca1f99.poster.avif?t=1781141077\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4824290/extras/c63cfb2453c97ad3a203220593ca1f99.webm?t=1781141077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4824290/extras/c63cfb2453c97ad3a203220593ca1f99.mp4?t=1781141077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Follow the Signals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the signals to learn what they measure and where they lead. They are the key to your freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4824290/extras/f58aab026b61b306ef3789ff3a53db58.poster.avif?t=1781141077\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4824290/extras/f58aab026b61b306ef3789ff3a53db58.webm?t=1781141077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4824290/extras/f58aab026b61b306ef3789ff3a53db58.mp4?t=1781141077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Free that which Binds You</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This place holds a power. One that can be harnessed. One that will free you and your captor. It has to work. Something has to work. Right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4824290/extras/5baa0997bf8ee5bfeed60a966d02b05f.poster.avif?t=1781141077\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4824290/extras/5baa0997bf8ee5bfeed60a966d02b05f.webm?t=1781141077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4824290/extras/5baa0997bf8ee5bfeed60a966d02b05f.mp4?t=1781141077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Star Sine Signal is a short first-person non-linear puzzle game about exploring an ominous house ripped from time in order to free yourself, and your captor, from your shared prison. Activate the Signals. Follow the Signals. Free that which Binds You.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You Awaken in a Strange Place</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An otherworld being has plucked you from your reality and trapped you in their extradimensional prison. If you want to escape you are going to have to help them escape as well. Looks like you have no choice.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4824290/extras/4c963a72987970654133f8691ff7c273.poster.avif?t=1781141077\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\